@startuml
!include ../_fragments/style.puml
!include ../_fragments/legend.puml
!include ../_fragments/lifelines.puml


BP_STYLE()
BP_LIFELINES()
BP_LEGEND()


title Go/No-Go LIVE: допуск и запуск сессии (M10→M11)\n@version LIVE.v1
autonumber


Admin -> API: POST /api/live/approve {exchange,instrument,tf, quorumVersion, riskRef, criteriaRef}
API -> DB: load performance_aggregate (M9) for candidate
API -> DB: load criteria (minTrades, maxDD, Sharpe, expectancy, winrate, …)
API -> API: evaluate criteria
alt meets criteria (Go)
API -> DB: INSERT live_whitelist {exchange_instrument, tf, quorumVersion, riskRef}
API -> Live: start session {exchange_instrument, tf, quorumVersion, riskRef}
Live -> Risk: verify isolated/x10, ≤1% per trade
Risk --> Live: sizing policy ok
Live -> ExConn: setMarginMode(ISOLATED); setLeverage(≤10)
ExConn -> ExREST: API calls
ExREST --> ExConn: ack
ExConn --> Live: ok
Live -> DB: create live_session (status=RUNNING)
Live --> API: sessionId
API --> Admin: Approved & Started {sessionId}
else fails criteria (No-Go)
API --> Admin: Rejected {reasons: ["Sharpe<1.0", "trades<200", …]}
end


== Execution guardrails ==
Live -> DB: read loss-streak threshold
Live -> Live: monitor guardrails, pause if breached


note over API,DB
Источник прав на старт — whitelist по результатам M9\n
и проверке критериев (настраиваемых). Любой запуск\n
вне whitelist — запрещён.
end note
@enduml